# PSR-4b-defaults — remove `workspaceType ?? "denali"`

## Scope

| Work | Done |
| --- | --- |
| `migrateWorkspaceCanonicalForTenant` require explicit `workspaceType` | Yes |
| `buildTourPublishedRemapUpsert` fail-closed without type on synthetic profileId | Yes |
| Update callers/tests | Yes |
| Host-import rewrites / export deletion | **No** (later slices) |

## Changes

| Site | Before | After |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `canonical/migrate-canonical-workspace.service.ts` | `options.workspaceType ?? "denali"` | throw `MIGRATE_CANONICAL_WORKSPACE_TYPE_REQUIRED` |
| `integrations/migration/tour-published-exposure-remap-plan.ts` | `` `${workspaceType ?? "denali"}.telegram…` `` | throw `TOUR_PUBLISHED_REMAP_WORKSPACE_TYPE_REQUIRED` |

`.TourCreated` → `.TourPublished` rewrite path unchanged (no default needed).

## Tests

- Unit: missing `workspaceType` rejects on migrate helper
- Unit: synthetic remap profile without type throws
- Integration migrate specs pass `workspaceType: "denali"` explicitly

## Ratchet

`psr-4b-api-neutrality-smoke.mjs` now enforces **0** `workspaceType ?? "denali"` in
`apps/api/src` and empty `product_defaults` in the inventory YAML.

## Exit gate

| Check | Result |
| --- | --- |
| Zero `?? "denali"` product defaults in API src | required |
| Fail-closed errors documented | required |
| Host-source ceiling unchanged (11) | required |
| No Denali export deletion | required |
